## Provenance

Not all of these assets originate in this repository, and none of them are
third-party works.

- `graphics/casts/`, `audio/<cast>/` — byte-identical copies of art and audio
  committed by the four source games (Legend of Kilix, Chumrunner, Kilix
  Fantasy, Pleb Bound), maintained by `tools/sync_source_parity.py`. Those
  games are separate projects by the same author; the copies here are covered
  by this license, which does not enlarge any rights in the source games
  themselves.
- `graphics/items/` — composed per style from each source game's own art by
  `tools/sync_item_art.py`.
- `graphics/rooms/` — original room plates for this project, produced with an
  image-generation pipeline (`gemini-3-pro-image`, cooked to 1280x720 by
  `tools/prepare_plate.py`). The prompts that produced them are recorded
  verbatim in `graphics/rooms/PROMPTS.md`, and their hashes in
  `graphics/manifest.json`.
- `world/` — hand-authored world, item, and occlusion data for this project.
